- **核心病机**：[脾胃气虚证](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%84%BE%E8%83%83%E6%B0%94%E8%99%9A%E8%AF%81/5988866)
- **次要病机**：[湿热内蕴](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%B9%BF%E7%83%AD%E5%86%85%E8%95%B4/2875214)
